S = {'cc': 'GT', 'fam': 'Consumption', 'doc': '# Guatemala 2025: Impuesto al Valor Agregado (5111); fuel and drinks distribution taxes (5121)\n\nSources: Decreto 32-2001 del Congreso (Diario de Centro América, 2001), Congreso PDF via Wayback (capture 2025-08-12;\n`gt/law/decreto_32_2001.pdf`, scanned: OCR `decreto_32_2001.ocr.txt`; ARCHIVE_INDEX.tsv); Decreto 10-2012 Libro III\n(the 1.x builder\'s copy `world/B12-latin-america/gt/src/d10_2012.txt`), which reforms arts. 3, 8, 16, 23, 24, 29, 55-57\nof the Ley del IVA but not art. 10 or art. 7. The consolidated Ley del IVA (Decreto 27-92) was not reached (SAT portal\n403; the Congreso 27-92 capture holds one page): grade B.\n* **Art. 10** as reformed by Decreto 32-2001 art. 1: taxpayers "pagarán el impuesto con una tarifa del doce por ciento\n  (12%) sobre la base imponible. La tarifa del impuesto en todos los casos deberá estar incluida en el precio de venta"\n  (single rate). In force from publication (art. 3).\n* The art. 7 exemptions (education, interest, rent of dwellings, cooperatives and the like) and the pequeño contribuyente\n  regime (Decreto 10-2012) are not held: every good is charged at 12 % (upper bound, flagged).\n\n**Specific taxes (pass 12, grade A):**\n* **Fuels: Decreto 38-92 art. 12 "A"**, added by **Decreto 11-2003 art. 5** (`gt/law/reforma_ley_alcoholes_scp.pdf`,\n  scp.gob.gt copy of the decree): "tasas específicas, por galón americano de 3.785 litros: Gasolina superior Q. 4.70,\n  Gasolina regular Q. 4.60 ... Diesel y gas oil Q. 1.30". Per litre: 4.60 / 3.785 and 1.30 / 3.785. Petrol is read as\n  gasolina regular (superior Q 4.70 flagged). Later amendments of art. 12 "A" not identified (Decreto 10-2012 and 4-2012\n  do not touch it: checked by grep); a temporary suspension decree for 2025 not found.\n* **Drinks: Decreto 21-2004** (`gt/law/d21_2004_alcohol_scp.pdf`, scp.gob.gt): art. 9 base = "el precio de venta al\n  consumidor final sugerido por el fabricante o el importador ... sin incluir en dicho precio, el Impuesto al Valor\n  Agregado, ni el impuesto a la distribución" - the consumer amount net of both, as the kernel line reads it; art. 10\n  cervezas 6 %, art. 11 vinos 7.5 %, art. 15 bebidas alcohólicas destiladas 8.5 %. The suggested price is taken equal to\n  the price paid (flagged). Decreto 4-2012 Libro VII reforms only the tobacco law (61-77), not 21-2004.\n* **Tobacco (Decreto 61-77 art. 27)**: only the Decreto 4-2012 art. 69 reform of the second paragraph is held (base not\n  less than 75 % of the suggested price net of IVA and the specific tax); the rate paragraph is not held: grade C.', 'vat': {'name': 'Impuesto al Valor Agregado', 'standard': 1200, 'statute': 'Ley del IVA (Decreto 27-92) art. 10 as reformed by Decreto 32-2001 art. 1: 12 %, included in the price'}, 'unsupported': [['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .education || s.good == .financial || s.good == .rent || s.good == .health || s.good == .insurance || s.good == .transport || s.good == .medicines', 'art. 7 exemptions of the Ley del IVA (Decreto 27-92) not held: charged at 12 % (upper bound)'], ['g.consumption.length > 0', 'purchases from pequeños contribuyentes (simplified regime, Decreto 10-2012) carry no IVA invoice at 12 %: all spending charged at 12 % (upper bound)'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .cigarettes || s.good == .tobaccoOther', 'tobacco tax (Decreto 61-77 art. 27): rate paragraph not held, grade C'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .petrol', 'petrol read as gasolina regular (Q 4.60/gal; superior Q 4.70)'], ['g.consumption.any fun s => s.good == .beer || s.good == .wine || s.good == .spirits', 'drinks: the suggested consumer price (art. 9) taken equal to the price paid; sparkling wine, vermouth, cider, mixed drinks (all 7.5 %) read as wine']], 'ex': [{'good': 'petrol', 'name': 'Impuesto a la distribución de combustibles (gasolina regular)', 'num': 460000, 'den': 378500, 'statute': 'Decreto 38-92 art. 12 A (Decreto 11-2003 art. 5): Q 4.60 per US gallon of 3.785 litres'}, {'good': 'diesel', 'name': 'Impuesto a la distribución de combustibles (diésel)', 'num': 130000, 'den': 378500, 'statute': 'Decreto 38-92 art. 12 A (Decreto 11-2003 art. 5): Q 1.30 per US gallon of 3.785 litres'}, {'good': 'beer', 'name': 'Impuesto a la distribución de cervezas', 'adv': 600, 'vat': 1200, 'statute': 'Decreto 21-2004 arts. 9, 10 (6 % of the suggested consumer price net of IVA and the tax)'}, {'good': 'wine', 'name': 'Impuesto a la distribución de vinos', 'adv': 750, 'vat': 1200, 'statute': 'Decreto 21-2004 arts. 9, 11 (7.5 %)'}, {'good': 'spirits', 'name': 'Impuesto a la distribución de bebidas alcohólicas destiladas', 'adv': 850, 'vat': 1200, 'statute': 'Decreto 21-2004 arts. 9, 15 (8.5 %)'}], 'guards': ['vat.embedded { good := .clothing, amount := 1120 } == 120', 'vat.embedded { good := .food, amount := 1120 } == 120', 'vat.standard == 1200', '-- 100 litres of regular petrol: 100 x 4.60 / 3.785 = 121.53', '(lines.find? (·.good == .petrol)).get!.duty { good := .petrol, amount := 3000, quantity := 100000 } == 121', '-- 100 litres of diesel: 100 x 1.30 / 3.785 = 34.35', '(lines.find? (·.good == .diesel)).get!.duty { good := .diesel, amount := 2500, quantity := 100000 } == 34', '-- beer Q 1,120 paid: net of IVA 1,000, net of the tax 1,000 / 1.06 = 943, 6 % = 56.6', '(lines.find? (·.good == .beer)).get!.duty { good := .beer, amount := 1120 } == 56'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '5111', 'tax': 'Impuesto al Valor Agregado', 'statute': 'Ley del IVA (Decreto 27-92) art. 10 (Decreto 32-2001 art. 1)', 'dated': 'Decreto 32-2001 (in force on publication, 2001); not reformed by Decreto 10-2012', 'grade': 'B', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['Vat'], 'unsupported': ['art. 7 exemptions', 'pequeño contribuyente regime']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Impuesto a la distribución de petróleo crudo y combustibles derivados', 'statute': 'Decreto 38-92 art. 12 A (Decreto 11-2003 art. 5)', 'dated': 'Decreto 11-2003; later amendments of art. 12 A not identified', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['ExLine'], 'unsupported': ['petrol read as regular']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Impuesto sobre la distribución de bebidas alcohólicas destiladas, cervezas y otras bebidas fermentadas', 'statute': 'Decreto 21-2004 arts. 9-17', 'dated': 'Decreto 21-2004 (scp.gob.gt copy); Decreto 4-2012 does not reform it', 'grade': 'A', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['ExLine'], 'unsupported': ['suggested price taken as the price paid']}, {'oecd': '5121', 'tax': 'Impuesto sobre tabacos y sus productos', 'statute': 'Decreto 61-77 art. 27 (Decreto 4-2012 art. 69)', 'grade': 'C', 'status': 'unsupported', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': [], 'tried': 'pass 12: only the Decreto 4-2012 reform of the base paragraph held (WHO FCTC copy)', 'unsupported': ['would unlock: Decreto 61-77 as in force 2025 (rate paragraph of art. 27)']}, {'oecd': '5112', 'tax': 'General sales / turnover tax (other than VAT)', 'statute': 'Constitución art. 239', 'dated': 'lexifina repository text; pass 12, 2026-11-21', 'grade': 'A', 'status': 'not levied', 'package': 'P1', 'kernel_parts': ['Absent'], 'why': 'Not levied (convention R5-3k-G, pass 12): Constitución art. 239: "Corresponde con exclusividad al Congreso de la República, decretar impuestos ordinarios y extraordinarios" (`gt/law/const_art-239.md`). no law read in this build levies a general sales or turnover tax beside the VAT of the 5111 row (laws read include: Ley del IVA (Decreto 27-92) art. 10 (Decreto 32-2001 art. 1); Decreto 38-92 art. 12 A (Decreto 11-2003 art. 5); Decreto 21-2004 arts. 9-17; Decreto 10-2012 art. 36 (25 %); Decreto 10-2012 Libro I Título V arts. 97-99, 103-105 (art. 104 num. 1 d. repealed by Decreto 19-2013 art. 28); 1.x model (see its summary.json)).'}], 'absent': [['salesTax', 'Not levied (convention R5-3k-G, pass 12): Constitución art. 239: "Corresponde con exclusividad al Congreso de la República, decretar impuestos ordinarios y extraordinarios" (`gt/law/const_art-239.md`). no law read in this build levies a general sales or turnover tax beside the VAT of the 5111 row (laws read include: Ley del IVA (Decreto 27-92) art. 10 (Decreto 32-2001 art. 1); Decreto 38-92 art. 12 A (Decreto 11-2003 art. 5); Decreto 21-2004 arts. 9-17; Decreto 10-2012 art. 36 (25 %); Decreto 10-2012 Libro I Título V arts. 97-99, 103-105 (art. 104 num. 1 d. repealed by Decreto 19-2013 art. 28); 1.x model (see its summary.json)).']]}
